  {
    "id": "ftp_sessions_dual",
    "proto": "ftp",
    "summary": "T-FTP-2 sessions: 双会话（RETR+LIST），独立 TCP 连接、独立数据通道；48 帧 = 2×24",
    "spec_json": {
      "src_ip": "10.0.0.1",
      "dst_ip": "20.0.0.1",
      "src_port": 21000,
      "dst_port": 21,
      "count": 1,
      "ftp": {
        "sessions": [
          {
            "src_port": 20000,
            "banner": "220 s1",
            "transactions": [
              {
                "commands": [
                  {
                    "cmd": "USER anonymous",
                    "response": "331"
                  },
                  {
                    "cmd": "PASV",
                    "response": "227 Entering Passive Mode (20,0,0,1,195,73)"
                  },
                  {
                    "cmd": "RETR /a.bin",
                    "response": "150",
                    "emit_data_channel": true
                  },
                  {
                    "cmd": "",
                    "response": "226 done"
                  }
                ],
                "data_channel": {
                  "payload": "FILE-A"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "src_port": 20001,
            "banner": "220 s2",
            "transactions": [
              {
                "commands": [
                  {
                    "cmd": "CWD /pub",
                    "response": "250"
                  },
                  {
                    "cmd": "PASV",
                    "response": "227 Entering Passive Mode (20,0,0,1,195,74)"
                  },
                  {
                    "cmd": "LIST",
                    "response": "150",
                    "emit_data_channel": true
                  },
                  {
                    "cmd": "",
                    "response": "226 done"
                  }
                ],
                "data_channel": {
                  "payload": "DIR-LIST"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "expect": {
      "min_packets": 48,
      "packet_count": 48,
      "negotiated": true,
      "terminates": true,
      "has_handshake": true,
      "has_payload": true,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "tcp.srcport",
          "value": "20000"
        },
        {
          "packet": 25,
          "field": "tcp.srcport",
          "value": "20001"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "每会话 24 帧 = 控制 15（3hs+banner+3cmd×2+空cmd 1+4teardown）+ 数据通道 9；会话1 数据口 195*256+73=49993，会话2 195*256+74=49994；独立序号/握手/挥手"
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "ftp_txindex_dual",
    "proto": "ftp",
    "summary": "T-FTP-3: 单会话双事务，两条数据流 parent 索引 sub-0/sub-1 区分，PASV 50011/50012",
    "spec_json": {
      "src_ip": "10.0.0.1",
      "dst_ip": "20.0.0.1",
      "src_port": 22000,
      "dst_port": 21,
      "count": 1,
      "ftp": {
        "sessions": [
          {
            "banner": "220 s",
            "transactions": [
              {
                "commands": [
                  {
                    "cmd": "PASV",
                    "response": "227 Entering Passive Mode (20,0,0,1,195,91)"
                  },
                  {
                    "cmd": "RETR /f0.bin",
                    "response": "150",
                    "emit_data_channel": true
                  }
                ],
                "data_channel": {
                  "payload": "D0"
                }
              },
              {
                "commands": [
                  {
                    "cmd": "PASV",
                    "response": "227 Entering Passive Mode (20,0,0,1,195,92)"
                  },
                  {
                    "cmd": "LIST",
                    "response": "150",
                    "emit_data_channel": true
                  }
                ],
                "data_channel": {
                  "payload": "D1"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "expect": {
      "min_packets": 34,
      "negotiated": true,
      "terminates": true,
      "has_handshake": true,
      "has_payload": true,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "tcp.srcport",
          "value": "22000"
        },
        {
          "packet": 9,
          "field": "tcp.dstport",
          "value": "50011"
        },
        {
          "packet": 22,
          "field": "tcp.dstport",
          "value": "50012"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "控制 16（3hs+banner+tx1 2cmd×2+tx2 2cmd×2+4teardown）+ 数据 9×2 = 34；数据-1 内联挂在 150@8 之后（SYN@9），数据-2 SYN@22；sub-0 口 195*256+91=50011，sub-1 195*256+92=50012"
      ],
      "packet_count": 34
    }
  },
